nnectedcontests.org/database/events/30028"}]}, "Phanas of Pellene is recorded as the first athlete to sweep the three running events at the 512 BC Olympics.\n\n- **Victory record:** Eusebius lists him as a stadion winner at the 65th Olympiad (512 BC), and he is credited with being the first to take the stadion, diaulos, and hoplitodromos together (Wikipedia).\n- **Olympedia:** Its entries for the 512 BCE Games list him as the gold medalist in all three events: stadion, diaulos, and the race in armor (Olympedia Pellene country page).\n- **Connected Contests:** This database gives his origin as Pellana in Achaia, not Pellene, and notes that he was the first to win all three running disciplines, which made him the first \"triastes\" (connectedcontests.org).\n- **Greek Ministry of Culture:** Its profile of Phanas is a short story page with no detail beyond his name and origin, so it adds little to the record (olympicgames.culture.gov.gr).\n\nThe main discrepancy is the place name: Wikipedia and Olympedia use Pellene, while Connected Contests uses Pellana (both in Achaia). I did not find any source that contradicts the 512 BC date or the triple win."], "durationSeconds": 5.726159416000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01R4VTyCgdVMWcdfQDkrezj2", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWR6PPiezn8S4fkUXve", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "在公元前 512 年的奥运会（第 65 届）上，帕伦涅的法纳斯（Phanas of Pellene）除了武装赛跑，还赢了另外两项：\n1. **短跑（stadion）**，一个跑道长度，约 192 米\n2. **双程跑（diaulos）**，两个跑道长度，约 384 米\n\n据记载，他是第一个在同一届奥运会上拿下这三项赛跑的人，也就是第一位\"triastes\"（三项冠军）。我只搜了 1 次。\n\nConnected Contests 把他的家乡写成 Pellana（阿哈伊亚），维基百科和 Olympedia 写的是 Pellene。年份和三项夺冠这两点，几个来源说法相同。\n\n来源：\n- [Phanas of Pellene – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phanas_of_Pellene)\n- [Olympedia – Pellene, 512 BCE](https://www.olympedia.org/countries/PEL/editions/144)\n- [Connected Contests – Phanas from Pellana (Achaia)](https://connectedcontests.org/database/persons/2152)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1077, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1077}, "output_tokens": 397, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:42:50.636Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWR66X4otXsMqvtAQEa"}
